From 3c285aa266795559d44272c65288c000ed909a09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: isabel <isabel@isabelroses.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 20:26:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] libmain: add nom log format

Adds `--log-format nom` and `nom-with-logs`: an in-process logger that
draws the running builds as a dependency tree with a status table
underneath.

Also shows duration estimates from earlier builds, per-build CPU usage
from the build cgroup on Linux, and Nerd Font icons when available.
