@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+---
+synopsis: "new `nom` log format"
+cls: []
+category: "Features"
+credits: [isabelroses]
+---
+
+The new `nom` and `nom-with-logs` values of [`log-format`](@docroot@/command-ref/conf-file.md#conf-log-format) draw the running builds and transfers as a tree with a table of status counts beneath it, in the style of the nom output monitor:
+
+```
+╭─ Builds
+├─ ⏵ hello-2.12.2  ⏱ 1m5s (buildPhase)
+│  ╰─ ✔ dependency-1.0  ⏱ 12s
+├─ ↓ breakpad-2024.02.16   ━━━━━━╸─────────────────────   24%  1.2 MiB/5.0 MiB
+┢━ Status      Running   Completed   Waiting   Total
+┃  Builds      ⏵ 1       ✔ 1         ⏸ 3       ∑ 5
+┃  Downloads   ↓ 1       ↓ 3         ⏸ 2       ∑ 6
+┗━ Elapsed ⏱ 1m17s
+```
+
+A finished build is shown beneath the build that uses it, once that one starts.
+Lix does not report which builds are still waiting, so those are only counted.
